        "S03-E03"
      ],
      "interpretation": "EO reduced target PFAS concentrations; the decrease in EOF after EO was similar to the degradation of the measured target PFAS, indicating concurrent loss of parent PFAS and reduction in extractable organofluorine.",
      "reported_term": "target PFAS degradation during EO"
    },
    {
      "endpoint_type": "total_organofluorine_change",
      "evidence_locator_ids": [
        "S03-E03",
        "S03-E08"
