        "S03-E04",
        "S03-E07"
      ],
      "statement": "For full-scale implementation of the FF\u2013EO treatment train, it is crucial to confirm that all PFAS removed from the influent by foam fractionation are quantitatively transferred to the foam so they can be degraded by EO; current mass balance uncertainties and low PFSA degradation in foam highlight this as an implementation challenge."
    }
